ego, and superego far beyond reason. As you explore the Institute, you will uncover what was done to its patients \u2014 and what was done to you.\n\n## Remastered for VR Horror\n\n- Rebuilt models, textures, and environments\n- Expanded locations with new areas not seen in the original release\n- Fully reworked soundtrack and sound design with immersive 3D spatial audio\n- Refined gameplay and major improvements based on player feedback\n\n## Explore the Institute\n\n- Interact with a physics-driven VR world\n- Pick up, examine, and use objects to progress\n- Solve environmental puzzles by paying attention to small details\n- Uncover the history of the Institute and its patients\n\n## Survive the Horror\n\n- Manage scarce ammunition where every bullet matters\n- Reload, aim, and fire under pressure with realistic weapon handling\n- Face the horrors still wandering the halls of the Triton Institute\n\nAfter everything Dr. Simmons has done, one question remains:\n\n**How much of you is still left?**", "short_description": "Fractured Sanity is a psychological VR horror experience set inside the Triton Institute, a notorious mental asylum where Dr. Matthew Simmons\u2019 experiments push the human mind beyond its limits. Explore expanded areas, survive terrifying encounters, and uncover what was done to you in a remaster rebuilt with redesigned visuals, reworked environments, and immersive spatial audio that keeps the horror uncomfortably close."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fracturedsanity.unitedgames.com.br/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "United Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fracturedsanity.unitedgames.com.br/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "6443548